## Key Points to Cover
- ROI = Net Benefit / Cost (with timing nuances)
- Analyze at initiative, phase, or program level
- Benefit categories: revenue, cost, risk, strategic
- Cost categories: implementation, ongoing, transition
- Metrics: Simple ROI, NPV, IRR, Payback Period
- Scenario and sensitivity analysis
- Executive-friendly communication formats

